  "worked_solution": "The tangent line approximation of $s(t)$ at the point $a=10$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L(t) & =s(a)+{s}^{\u2032}(a)(t-a) \\\\  & =s(10)+{s}^{\u2032}(10)(t-10) \\\\  & =4.6+0.48(t-10).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can approximate $s(11)$ by evaluating the tangent line approximation at $t=11.$ We get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}s(11) & \u2248L(11) \\\\  & =4.6+0.48(11-10) \\\\  & =4.6+0.48(1) \\\\  & =4.6+0.48 \\\\  & =5.08.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe distance traveled by the drone at $t=11$ minutes is estimated to be $5.08$ kilometers.",
